%% Figure 3 — Nightly settling sequence (order is not interchangeable)
%% Used in: zh/01-memory.md §2.1, en/01-memory.md §2.1
sequenceDiagram
  participant N as Nightly chain
  participant S as Session family
  participant R as Memory files
  N->>S: 1. Extract — daily digest + blind review + index rebuild
  N->>R: write L1 / L2 artefacts
  N->>S: 2. Second distill — condense the day into experience candidates
  N->>R: write experience body + candidate evidence
  N->>S: 3. Rotate — archive sessions, start fresh
  Note over N,S: Invariant: settling precedes rotation (INV-M4)
  Note over N,R: On failure: report the gap, do not re-run (INV-M6)
